# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 9 as ruled (round 3 DY: a supplier's dynamic answer gives the place its first value in the birth tick, and each later change is a push delivered the next tick, which is owed) and Type System ch. 2 ("Bundles": the bundle is answered part by part): both parts stay live.
test two_dynamic_parts_answered

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="join")
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="idle, 0 peers")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click

tick 2
  changed:
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="busy, 1 peers")

tick 3
  in:
    0: click

tick 4
  changed:
    1/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="busy, 2 peers")
